m+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/6053558932680407468'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/6053558932680407468'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1316241672772#c6053558932680407468' title=''/><author><name>jselvy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09441795049452839191</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-152920624"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 17, 2011 at 12:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2224935127621454859</id><published>2011-09-11T13:30:35.950-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-11T13:30:35.950-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sadly Conn is dead or in a DHS holding facility fo...</title><content type='html'>Sadly Conn is dead or in a DHS holding facility for being a Domestic terrorist.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;China&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2224935127621454859'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2224935127621454859'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315769435950#c2224935127621454859' title=''/><author><name>chinasyndrome</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04085960000175006256</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_79L0zVMX7PI/S7sjVcjjHeI/AAAAAAAAACM/iu7LCBVV8Fc/S220/Chinasyndrome.bmp'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1652374753"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 11, 2011 at 1:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1070344980356930723</id><published>2011-09-10T20:37:44.368-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-10T20:37:44.368-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The kakistocracy is fun. We&amp;#39;ll have a good lau...</title><content type='html'>The kakistocracy is fun. We&amp;#39;ll have a good laugh and drink some beers as they take us all to our doom.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/1070344980356930723'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/1070344980356930723'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315708664368#c1070344980356930723' title=''/><author><name>Festus Haggins</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1770218652"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 10, 2011 at 8:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7980476475838572126</id><published>2011-09-10T14:45:14.943-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-10T14:45:14.943-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I wasn&amp;#39;t graced with the time to stare at the ...</title><content type='html'>I wasn&amp;#39;t graced with the time to stare at the TeeVee and observe the apparent love fest showered upon Perry and Romney by the chattering class.  It was the following day when I nearly fell out of my seat at the political fellatio being exhibited .  In their hive-mind the race was over and it was ALL ABOUT these two clowns.  Matters of life and death were being distilled into &amp;#39;The Real Whores of America&amp;#39; or some such rot whereupon you the audience gets screwed violently on their dime.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/7980476475838572126'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/7980476475838572126'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315687514943#c7980476475838572126' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 10, 2011 at 2:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5593178716064175334</id><published>2011-09-10T01:27:13.528-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-10T01:27:13.528-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Outstanding article as usual.  It was also great t...</title><content type='html'>Outstanding article as usual.  It was also great to see your article from 2007 about basically the same thing -- just with a different bully. The good news, however, is just look at how many more followers of liberty Ron paul has created since his last run?  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;He has probably increased followers of liberty at least ten fold, and the future will just continue to create more and more.  For once, the liberty movement has some good news...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- A longtime fan of yours from your years at the New American and sf.com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/5593178716064175334'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/5593178716064175334'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315639633528#c5593178716064175334' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-769112858"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 10, 2011 at 1:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-21076388985437636</id><published>2011-09-09T05:42:44.140-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-09T05:42:44.140-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My take on the whole affair:&#xa;&#xa;http://militantliber...</title><content type='html'>My take on the whole affair:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://militantlibertarian.org/2011/09/08/paul-vs-perry-the-truth-revealed/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/21076388985437636'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/21076388985437636'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315568564140#c21076388985437636' title=''/><author><name>Aaron Turpen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07774655996138807357</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_Qnx8OOr4qYg/TS9XYahclZI/AAAAAAAAA8k/7z7-qKBE69g/S220/Picture%2B17.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-848525727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2011 at 5:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2482976505115535494</id><published>2011-09-08T18:47:37.071-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-08T18:47:37.071-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Liberranter: no joke - we must be old friends. If ...</title><content type='html'>Liberranter: no joke - we must be old friends. If you&amp;#39;ve actually SEEN that happen, I&amp;#39;d be sure of it.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I learned young that the only fight one ever wins is the one in which one never gets hit - and if honorable avoidance is impossible, well....&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s damn hard for a punk go to make a fist with a broken index-finger...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Usually that was enough.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My first thought when I saw that pic - before I&amp;#39;d read one word of your essay - was &amp;quot;Boy, you NEED to take two steps back, before something BAD happens to you!&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Put your hands on me *AND* your finger in my face?  Better make that THREE steps!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I don&amp;#39;t NEED to know what happened - my already-low opinion of Dick Perry just went sub-terranean.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2482976505115535494'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2482976505115535494'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315529257071#c2482976505115535494' title=''/><author><name>Dedicated_Dad</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/06375339835638311982</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-725583985"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 8, 2011 at 6:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2452262852781346534</id><published>2011-09-08T18:23:48.476-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-08T18:23:48.476-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s almost a shame that Ron Paul is Ron Paul,...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s almost a shame that Ron Paul is Ron Paul, a man with more honor and moral integrity in the trimmings of one fingernail than Dick Perry has in his entire body.  It is a delicious fantasy to imagine Ron, were he anyone else, grabbing Dickie&amp;#39;s index finger, bending it backward till the bone gave way with a shudder-inducing snap, and then, as the paper cowboy screamed like a scalded toddler, suggesting in the most sarcastic voice he could muster that Dickie &amp;quot;find a doctor somewhere to fix that finger.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2452262852781346534'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/2452262852781346534'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315527828476#c2452262852781346534' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 8, 2011 at 6:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3587599385308884001</id><published>2011-09-08T18:17:17.521-06:00</published><updated>2011-09-08T18:17:17.521-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Amen and posted.</title><content type='html'>Amen and posted.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/3587599385308884001'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5324542866315565789/comments/default/3587599385308884001'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html?showComment=1315527437521#c3587599385308884001' title=''/><author><name>Brock Townsend</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11404173139501539265</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_YJQ6fD7smOY/S2Hj1F08b1I/AAAAAAAAALc/Sbw7hnZvDR8/S220/Core+Creek+Militia.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/09/where-have-you-gone-conn-conagher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5324542866315565789' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5324542866315565789' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1383762707"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 8, 2011 at 6:17 PM"/></entry></feed>